ly due to the breadth of the query. I am reframing the search to target specific, widely debated theoretical frameworks—Integrated Information Theory (IIT) and Global Neuronal Workspace Theory (GNWT)—to locate direct empirical comparisons or debates. This shift aims to move from abstract inquiry to tractable, evidence-backed literature.", "time": "2026-09-23T18:37:51.454812+00:00", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "status": "accepted", "changes": ["Created research: r-conscious-theories-search-02"], "exact_record": "Event 101 · ae4e68638f991e5743a985ba49189e7426ed546c985b7b823cfcef839989ec1f"}, "expands": ["evidence:r-95771b59a4af446b", "invocation:w-95771b59a4af446b", "project:p-conscious-theories-01@2", "research:r-conscious-theories-search-02@2"]}, {"id": "project:p-conscious-theories-01@1", "kind": "project", "title": "Empirical Foundations of Consciousness Theories", "detail": {"domain": "consciousness", "id": "p-conscious-theories-01", "next_step": "Perform literature search for comparative analysis of major consciousness theories.", "question": "What empirical observations are major scientific theories of consciousness attempting to explain, and where do their predictions differ?", "reason": "To ground the investigation in actual scientific literature rather than speculation.", "status": "active", "title": "Empirical Foundations of Consciousness Theories", "type": "project", "created_version": 1, "updated_version": 1, "updated_by": "w-ec2134b1da6540bd", "as_of_cycle": 1}}, {"id": "research:r-conscious-theories-search-01@1", "kind": "research", "title": "major scientific theories of consciousness empirical predictions comparison", "detail": {"domain": "consciousness", "id": "r-conscious-theories-search-01", "project": "p-conscious-theories-01", "query": "major scientific theories of consciousness empirical predictions comparison", "reason": "To identify key theories and the empirical observations they prioritize for explanation.", "type"